okf/routers/items.md:15:# items
okf/routers/items.md:17:Prefix: `/items`. Every route requires a bearer token (`CurrentUser`).
okf/routers/items.md:21:| GET | `/items/` | Superusers see all items; everyone else sees only their own. Paginated (`skip`/`limit`), ordered by `created_at desc`. |
okf/routers/items.md:22:| GET | `/items/{id}` | 404 if missing, 403 if not owner and not superuser. |
okf/routers/items.md:23:| POST | `/items/` | `owner_id` is forced to `current_user.id` server-side — not settable by the client. |
okf/routers/items.md:24:| PUT | `/items/{id}` | Partial update (`exclude_unset`); same 404/403 ownership rules as GET. |
okf/routers/items.md:25:| DELETE | `/items/{id}` | Same ownership rules. |
okf/routers/items.md:27:Ownership check (`not current_user.is_superuser and item.owner_id != current_user.id`)
