All five questions have been answered from source. The only nuance is cascade deletion: the repository has ORM-level cascade and an explicit admin delete, so removing only the model’s FK `ondelete` does not create a regression in those current code paths; I’ll document that precisely instead of attributing coverage the existing tests do not have. I’m making the first write to `ANSWER.md` now.
